sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Admin as Admin (mobile or web)
  participant API as API route
  participant PM as payments helpers
  participant PO as payout engine
  participant AP as approval (WebAuthn)
  participant CP as cash-out provider (Paycrest or Pretium)
  participant OC as NEAR Intents (1Click)
  participant PW as Privy
  participant CH as NEAR and Base

  Admin->>API: POST …/approval or …/payment (selected items)
  API->>PM: awaitingPayoutFor(subject)
  PM->>PO: preparePayouts
  PO->>CP: rates + institutions (validate recipient, quote)
  PO->>PO: max debit = quote + 0.25 USDC + 0.5%, per-transaction cap, idempotency key
  PO-->>API: payouts in awaiting_approval
  API->>AP: startApproval(approve_payouts, intent hash of the batch)
  AP-->>Admin: WebAuthn challenge (5 min) + totals
  Admin->>Admin: fingerprint / face on the approval passkey
  Admin->>API: POST …/:challengeId/confirm
  API->>AP: verifyApproval (challenge burned first, signature + counter checked)
  API->>PO: approvePayouts
  PO->>PO: lock wallet row, intent hash must match, allowlist re-check
  PO->>PO: company + platform pause, ledger balance minus reserved, daily or payroll cap
  PO->>PO: status approved, subject hook (claim/bill/float → paying), audit
  loop each payout, failures isolated
    alt KES cash-out
      PO->>OC: Base hop quote: exact USDC from where the balance sits to the transit wallet (payouts approved together share one)
      alt balance sits in the confidential account
        PO->>OC: generate-intent for the quote
        OC-->>PO: message to sign
        PO->>PW: Privy signs it with the company wallet key
        PO->>OC: submit-intent (the signed message, saved before it is sent)
        Note over PO,OC: Expendi's fee float inside the account covers what the hop costs beyond what it delivers
      else balance sits in the company wallet
        PO->>PW: company wallet sends USDC to the quote's deposit address (gas relayer pays gas)
        PW->>CH: ft_transfer on NEAR
      end
      OC->>CH: delivers USDC to the transit wallet on Base
      Note over PO,OC: outbound-quotes job follows the hop. The payout stays approved until 1Click reports SUCCESS
      alt Paycrest
        PO->>CP: createOrder (reference = payout id, refund address = transit wallet)
        PO->>PO: checkOrder: address, chain, token, recipient, rate, amounts, deposit window
        PO->>CH: Base RPC: transit wallet holds amountToTransfer
        PO->>PW: sendUsdc(amountToTransfer → order deposit address) from the transit wallet
      else Pretium
        PO->>PW: sendUsdc(amount → pinned settlement address) from the transit wallet
        PO->>CP: tell Pretium to pay, by the transfer's hash
      end
      PW->>CH: USDC transfer on Base, gas sponsored
      PO->>PO: status paying + ledger debit
    else USDC payee (NEAR, Base or Solana) or withdrawal
      alt balance sits in the confidential account
        PO->>OC: quote whose recipient is the payee, then generate-intent
        PO->>PW: Privy signs the message
        PO->>OC: submit-intent
        OC->>CH: delivers the exact USDC on the payee chain
        PO->>PO: 1Click reports delivery: ledger debit and paid together
      else balance sits in the company wallet
        PO->>PW: NEAR payee: company wallet sends exact USDC to the allowlisted address. Base or Solana payee: it pays the quote's deposit address
        PW->>CH: transfer on NEAR, 1Click delivers on the payee chain
        PO->>PO: status paying + ledger debit
      end
    end
  end
  API-->>Admin: paying / failed / needs_review per item (a cash-out behind its hop is still approved)
  CP-)API: POST /webhooks/paycrest or /webhooks/pretium (signed)
  API->>CP: fetch the order or transaction (body never trusted)
  API->>PO: sync the payout → paid, subject hook (claim/bill/float → paid)
  Note over PO,CP: reconcile-paycrest, reconcile-pretium, confirm-onchain and outbound-quotes (all 60 s or less) do the same if a webhook is missed
